---
import HubLayout from '../layouts/HubLayout.astro';
---
<HubLayout title="Privacy — MyToolboxHub" description="How MyToolboxHub handles tool inputs, website visits, analytics, and contact emails.">
  <article class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-8 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary">Privacy</h1>
    <p>Updated September 10, 2026.</p>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Tool inputs</h2><p>The converters, formatters, generators, and text tools process input in your browser. Application code does not send the text or files you enter into tools to a processing server. Copy and download actions put the result on your clipboard or device. HTML conversion parses text without loading embedded resources.</p><p>This does not protect against a compromised device, browser extensions, screen sharing, or clipboard history. Use fictional or redacted inputs when reporting problems.</p></section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Website hosting and analytics</h2><p>GitHub Pages serves this website. Loading a page sends ordinary connection information to the hosting service, separately from the inputs you enter into a tool. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" class="text-accent underline">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>.</p><p>The website loads the hosted Plausible Analytics script from plausible.io to measure visits and page usage. Tool input is not included in analytics events by our code. See <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" class="text-accent underline">Plausible’s data policy</a> for the information it processes.</p></section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Storage and external links</h2><p>The current tool code does not save your input history to browser local storage or a user account. Your browser may retain downloaded files, clipboard data, and cached site resources. External links open services with their own privacy practices.</p></section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Contact by email</h2><p>If you email <a href="mailto:profitplannercraft@gmail.com" class="text-accent underline break-all">profitplannercraft@gmail.com</a>, the message and your email address are delivered to a Gmail inbox so the site operator can read and respond. This is separate from local tool processing. Do not include credentials or confidential records. For questions about a message you sent or a privacy concern, contact the same address.</p></section>
  </article>
</HubLayout>
